0:["T-vE3jocQsMrcy4PkMQjv",[[["",{"children":[["slug","the-most-challenging-voiceover-job","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"the-most-challenging-voiceover-job\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","the-most-challenging-voiceover-job","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/the-most-challenging-voiceover-job#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job!\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/the-most-challenging-voiceover-job\"}]}"}}],["$","script","schema-2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/the-most-challenging-voiceover-job#video\",\"name\":\"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job!\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/MiJFI4qPZaM/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MiJFI4qPZaM\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.webp\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"uploadDate\":\"2025-07-21T00:00:00+00:00\",\"description\":\"Guy Harris shares one of his strangest voiceover briefs, delivering a one-word script for PrePay Power with sonic branding specialists With Feeling.\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job!"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I was asked to help on a voiceover project where the script contained just one word, and that word was “No!”. Could I pull it off? Watch and find out.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/p-and-o-ferries-christmas-santa-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Voice of Santa for P&O Ferries Christmas Campaign","aria-label":"Previous: Voice of Santa for P&O Ferries Christmas Campaign","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/motor-sport-racing-commentator-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Vrroom Racing Commentator Voiceover - POV","aria-label":"Next: Vrroom Racing Commentator Voiceover - POV","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>What Made This the Most Challenging Voiceover?</h2><p>I love working with Chris and the team at <a href=\"https://withfeeling.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">With Feeling</a> in Dubai. They are a sonic branding company on another level, and whenever they get in touch, I know the project is going to be interesting.</p><p>Chris reached out to ask me to voice a project for PrePay Power, and the script turned out to be just one word: <strong>“Nooooooo!”</strong> Not a paragraph. Not a campaign manifesto. Just one gloriously stretched-out word that somehow needed to do all the heavy lifting. Needless to say, I nailed it.</p><p>It is a good reminder that voiceover is not always about reading long scripts. Sometimes the real skill is in delivering something tiny with exactly the right tone, timing, energy and intention. Even one word can need multiple shades of meaning before it lands properly.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MiJFI4qPZaM","title":"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job!","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/the-most-challenging-voiceover-job.webp","alt":"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job - Guy Harris","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job!"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>So who are With Feeling? They design sound and create music to spark engagement, performance and connection between people and organisations. Their work covers everything from sonic branding and original music composition to sound design, soundscapes, brand voices, tailored audio post-production and full turnkey solutions.</p><p>I have worked on several projects with them over the years, including <a href=\"/crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover\" title=\"Crowd Hub X Explainer Video Voiceover\">Crowd Hub X</a>, and they always bring a serious level of creative thinking to what they do. That makes it even more fun when a brief comes in that looks deceptively simple on paper but still demands a very precise performance.</p><p>This particular job may only have involved one word, but getting that word to hit properly still required control, interpretation and a willingness to fully commit. That is often the difference between a line that merely exists and one that genuinely works.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Got a strangely challenging script of your own? Whether it is one word, one line or a full campaign, I can help deliver it with clarity, character and proper professional polish. If you need an <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">experienced British voiceover</a> who can make even the shortest script count, get in touch using the form below.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"The Most Challenging Voiceover Job!","pageUrl":"the-most-challenging-voiceover-job"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","922",{"href":"/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice.jpg","alt":"boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Boom Beach Hammerman's hot tub"}]]}],["$","$L3","558",{"href":"/pathe-news-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pathe-news-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Pathe News Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],[